    "detailed_description": "Since <strong>Nekomew</strong> moved to his new home he started having <strong>terrible nightmares</strong>... can you overcome them? Follow the \ud83c\udfb5<strong>rhythm of the music</strong>\ud83c\udfb5... and avoid the <strong>spooky monsters</strong>!\ud83d\ude40 More than <strong>80 levels</strong> are waiting for you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/b27a319146a71368bcda702199e430e7.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dodge and dazzle</strong> monsters using the arrow keys on your keyboard \u2328\ufe0f or a compatible controller \ud83c\udfae. Play together with someone else <strong> cooperatively!</strong>\ud83e\udd1c\ud83e\udd1b<br><br>\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/c78f30b2e01a7b8f7b9443d04d954167.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.poster.avif?t=1666975190\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.webm?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/53e95d834bdec7865be85c81f5172ffa.mp4?t=1666975190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Will you master the multiple game modes? You can even create your musical levels and share them with others!<br><br>\u200e\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u2007<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893020/extras/0070347c1650d5a05f4d62f2d778c086.avif?t=1666975190\" /></div><br><br><strong>And Nekomew's Potty Trouble owners can get special content!</strong><br><br><br>\u2007\u2007\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007\u200e\u2007Join Nekomew in this spooky adventure. Will you discover the origin?<br><br><strong>Available languages</strong><br>\u2714 Spanish (Spain)<br>\u2714 Catalan<br>\u2714 English<br>\u2714 Simplified Chinese<br>\u2714 Korean<br>\u2714 Japanese<br>\u2714 Portuguese<br>\u2714 French<br>\u2714 German<br>\u2714 Italian",
